<title>SPAIN: Seat's 1996 Volkwagen brand output up strongly.</title>
<headline>Seat's 1996 Volkwagen brand output up strongly.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Seat production of Volkswagen cars was 83,279 units in 1996, around five times 1995's total of 16,220, Seat said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Seat brand cars totalled 331,934 units, up from 327,224 in 1995.</p>
<p>Of a total of 426,324 units sold, around 340,000 units were Seat brand vehicles.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
